+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives usage aggregated across all provider calls in the turn, so a deployer using the hook for billing or audit can account for tool-heavy turns ([validated by: reports usage from every provider call in a turn with two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/usageAcrossToolRounds.acceptance.test.ts#L13)).
+- Aggregation sums input tokens, output tokens, and total tokens from every provider round so the totals are additive across rounds ([validated by: sums token counts from two rounds](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L29)).
